    <entry>
      <title>archlinux+bspwm下的自动挂起和休眠</title>
      <link href="/posts/bb371655/"/>
      <url>/posts/bb371655/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="主旨"><a href="#主旨" class="headerlink" title="主旨"></a>主旨</h2><p>解决 <code>linux</code> 轻量安装下的自动锁屏、挂起和休眠问题, 主要工具：<code>xidlehook</code>, 锁屏工具: <code>betterlockscreen</code></p><h2 id="xidlehook"><a href="#xidlehook" class="headerlink" title="xidlehook"></a>xidlehook</h2><p><code>xidlehook</code> 是一个用 <code>Rust</code> 编写的工具，它是 <code>xautolock</code> 的现代化替代品。它的杀手级功能是 检测音频 —— 如果在看视频或听音乐，它不会自动挂起。</p><ol><li>安装</li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">yay -S xidlehook betterlockscreen</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="2"><li>在 <code>bspwm</code> 启动脚本中配置</li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 启动 xidlehook</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># --not-when-audio : 播放音频时不计时</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># --not-when-fullscreen : 全屏时不计时 (玩游戏/看电影)</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># --timer &lt;秒&gt; &lt;动作&gt; &lt;恢复动作&gt;</span></span><br><span class="line">xidlehook \</span><br><span class="line">--not-when-audio \</span><br><span class="line">--not-when-fullscreen \</span><br><span class="line">--timer 60 \</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&#x27;light -U 40&#x27;</span> \</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&#x27;light -A 40&#x27;</span> \</span><br><span class="line">--timer 120 \</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&#x27;betterlockscreen -l dim&#x27;</span> \</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&#x27;&#x27;</span> \</span><br><span class="line">--timer 300 \</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&#x27;systemctl suspend-then-hibernate&#x27;</span> \</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="string">&#x27;&#x27;</span> &amp;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="3"><li>可能需要执行下面这行</li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> <span class="built_in">ln</span> -s /usr/lib/systemd/system/nvidia-suspend-then-hibernate.service /etc/systemd/system/systemd-suspend-then-hibernate.service.wants/</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="确保合盖和手动挂起时锁屏-xss-lock"><a href="#确保合盖和手动挂起时锁屏-xss-lock" class="headerlink" title="确保合盖和手动挂起时锁屏 (xss-lock)"></a>确保合盖和手动挂起时锁屏 (xss-lock)</h2><p>如果你直接合上笔记本盖子，或者手动输入 <code>systemctl suspend</code>，系统会挂起，但唤醒时可能不会锁屏。为了解决这个问题，我们需要 <code>xss-lock</code>。它监听 systemd 的信号，一旦发现系统要休眠了，就强制先锁屏。</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">yay -S xss-lock</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 指定当你合盖或系统休眠时，使用什么命令来锁屏</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 这里以 betterlockscreen 为例</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 将下行命令添加到 bspwm 启动脚本中</span></span><br><span class="line">xss-lock --transfer-sleep-lock -- betterlockscreen -l dim &amp;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="tlp"><a href="#tlp" class="headerlink" title="tlp"></a>tlp</h2><p><code>TLP</code> 是 <code>Linux</code> 系统下最流行、功能最强大的高级电源管理工具，主要用于优化笔记本电脑的电池续航。<br>它的核心理念是 “安装即忘” (Install and Forget)。安装后，它会自动在后台运行，根据你当前是“接通电源 (AC)”还是“使用电池 (Battery)”的状态，自动调整系统的硬件参数以达到最佳的性能或最省电的效果。</p><ol><li>安装工具</li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 安装 tlp</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S tlp</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"> <span class="comment"># (可选) 如果你是 ThinkPad 用户，建议安装此包以获得更精确的电量读取</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> pacman -S tp_smapi acpi_call</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="2"><li>启动服务</li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> systemctl <span class="built_in">enable</span> tlp.service</span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> systemctl start tlp.service</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><ol start="3"><li>检查状态</li></ol><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查看简要状态</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> tlp-stat -s</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 查看电池详细信息（包括损耗程度）</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="built_in">sudo</span> tlp-stat -b</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
      
      
